#, fuzzy
msgid "Product Attribution"
msgstr "产品来源"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus platforms (such as the Quarkus platform BOM or vendor-provided platforms) may aggregate extensions that belong to supported products, also referred to as _offerings_. When an application is built on such a platform, product attribution represents each supported product as a dedicated component in the generated SBOM and links the application artifacts that belong to that product to it. This lets downstream tools see which parts of an application are covered by a given product and match them against product-level vulnerability and support information, for example by https://nvd.nist.gov/products/cpe[CPE]."
msgstr "Quarkus 平台（例如 Quarkus 平台 BOM 或供应商提供的平台）可能会聚合属于受支持产品的扩展，这些产品也称为 _“产品组合”_ 。 当应用程序构建在此类平台上时，产品归属机制会将每个受支持的产品作为生成 SBOM 中的专用组件进行呈现，并将属于该产品的应用程序工件与之关联。这使得下游工具能够识别应用程序中哪些部分由特定产品覆盖，并将其与产品级别的漏洞和支持信息进行匹配，例如通过 link:https://nvd.nist.gov/products/cpe[CPE] 进行匹配。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Product attribution is enabled by default and applies to every SBOM that includes the core application contribution (the dependency and distribution SBOMs). It can be disabled with:"
msgstr "产品归属功能默认处于启用状态，并适用于包含核心应用程序贡献的每个 SBOM（即依赖项和分发 SBOM）。可通过以下方式将其禁用："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "For the `quarkus:dependency-sbom` Maven goal the equivalent parameter is `quarkus.dependency.sbom.product-attribution`."
msgstr "对于 `quarkus:dependency-sbom` 这个 Maven 目标，其等效参数是 `quarkus.dependency.sbom.product-attribution` 。"

