#, fuzzy
msgid "Attribution is driven entirely by metadata the platform provides through its <<platform.adoc#product-attribution-properties,platform properties>>; an application does not configure products directly. Each imported platform member that declares a product identity (at minimum a CPE) yields, in the generated SBOM, a single product component that:"
msgstr "归属完全由平台通过其 xref:platform.adoc#product-attribution-properties[平台属性] 提供的元数据决定；应用程序不会直接配置产品。每个声明了产品标识（至少为 CPE）的导入平台成员，在生成的 SBOM 中都会生成一个产品组件，该组件："

#, fuzzy
msgid "has the type `framework` (unless the platform specifies a different type), carries the product's CPE, and has its CycloneDX `scope` set to `excluded`, since the product itself is not a shipped artifact;"
msgstr "具有该类型 `框架` （除非平台指定了其他类型），包含该产品的 CPE，且其 CycloneDX `作用域` 设置为 `“排除` ”，因为该产品本身并非已发布的构建产物；"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "is a top-level component, so it appears as a direct dependency of the main application component;"
msgstr "是一个顶级组件，因此它作为主应用程序组件的直接依赖项出现；"

#, fuzzy
msgid "_provides_ the artifacts attributed to it — the application's runtime extension artifacts that belong to the product, together with their dependencies. These are recorded as CycloneDX 1.6 `dependency.provides` relationships (the product provides/implements those artifacts). On schema versions older than 1.6, where `provides` is not available, the same artifacts are recorded as `dependsOn` relationships instead."
msgstr "_提供_ 归属于它的构建产物——属于该产品的应用程序运行时扩展构建产物及其依赖项。这些构建产物被记录为 CycloneDX 1.6 中的 `dependency.provides` 关系（即该产品提供/实现了这些构建产物）。 在早于 1.6 的模式版本中，由于不支持 ``provides`` ，这些相同的工件将作为 ``dependsOn` ` 关系进行记录。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Platform members that declare the *same* product PURL and CPE are merged into a single product component whose attributed artifacts are the union of the members' contributions."
msgstr "声明了 *相同* 产品 PURL 和 CPE 的平台成员将被合并为单一产品组件，该组件的属性相关成果是各成员贡献的并集。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Only artifacts that are actually present in the application and match the coordinates the platform attributed to the product are linked. If the application overrides the version of an attributed dependency, that dependency is not attributed to the product."
msgstr "只有实际存在于应用程序中且与平台为该产品分配的坐标相匹配的组件才会被关联。如果应用程序覆盖了某个已分配依赖项的版本，则该依赖项不会被分配给该产品。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "A product component is emitted whenever a platform member declares a CPE, even if none of its attributed artifacts end up present in the application."
msgstr "每当平台成员声明一个 CPE 时，都会发布一个产品组件，即使其所有带属性的工件最终都没有出现在应用程序中。"

